   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## TPS Paste: color and texture test (balloon)\n\nA large object filling half the mask. With color off the pasted sky and the left half of the face come out darker; on, they match. A plain color match over the cut would be pulled off by the red balloon.\n\n**Run it**, then compare:\n- **color off | color on** - the two pastes of the same edit.\n- **measure_view** - where color was measured (green band, red = what the edit changed, orange = changed outside the mask), the plateau before and after (red = edit darker, blue = brighter), the fitted grade, confidence and warnings.\n- **change_mask** - what the edit changed, found without a fixed threshold.\n\n**Try:** `color` grade + edge / grade / edge / off, `edge_profile` and `edge_width`, `texture`, `feather_detail` keep / plain, `grade_strength`.\n\nTPS Cut `size_multiple` 32 and the encoder's `resolution` 0 keep the cut at its own size. Qwen Image 2.1 shifts pixels by a few px; `align` full pulls the edit back first. The text encoder is `qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot`; no prompt enhancer.\n"
   ],
   "title": "Read me"
  }
